>
>Is there any value in being Crowned?  It happened to me and I didn't
>see any effect.  Is this just a booby prize?

If you are low level, it can be a pain, since most of the monsters that
you can safely kill have low food value.  If you are high level enough
to handle larger/tougher monsters such as ogres, giants, dragons, etc. it
is really nice since the hand gets:

    see invisible
    poison resistance
    fire resistance
    cold resistancd

In addition, if you are wielding an ordinary long sword, it turns into
Excalibur.
